@startuml

title Activity Program

class Program {
    + Main() : void
    + DisplayMenu(): void
    + RunActivity(choice: int): void
}

note right of Program
    The Program class is the entry point for the 
    program and displays the menu and takes the
    input from the user to initiate 
    the activity
end note

class Activity {

    - _name : string
    - _description : string
    - _duration : string

    + Activity(name : string, description : string)
    + StartMessage() : void
    + EndMessage() : void
    + PauseWhileSpinner() : void
    + PauseWithTimer(seconds : int) : void
    + RunActivity() : void

    

}

note right of Activity
    The base class for all activities.
    it defines shared behavior among
    all the classes
end note

class Breathing {

    + Breathing() : void
    + RunActivity() : void
    + BreathingCycle() : void

}

note right of Breathing
    Breathing inherits from Activity.
end note

class Reflection {
    - _reflectionPrompts : List<string>
    - _reflectionQuestions : List<string>

    + GetRandomPrompt() : string
    + GetRandomQuestionForPrompt() : string
    + DisplayPrompt() : void
    + DisplayQuestionsAboutPrompt() : void
    + RunActivity() : void

}

note right of Reflection
    Breathing inherits from Activity.
end note

class Listing {

    - _listingPrompts : List<string>
    - _userResponses : List<string>

    + Listing() : void
    + RunActivity() : void
    + GetRandomPrompt() : string
    + CollectResponses() : void
    + DisplayResults() : void
    
}

note right of Listing
    Breathing inherits from Activity.
end note

Program --> Activity : "initiates"
Activity <|-- Breathing
Activity <|-- Reflection
Activity <|-- Listing




@enduml